Z||000007||Standard||12-08-2000||01:18 AM||||Suspension bumper/bump stop is the cone shaped rubber thing mounted on the left and right lower front A-arms.  Made to stop a really big bump from damaging the shocks or other suspension components.  Never heard of one falling out, though..||||reg||1
Z||000008||theogre||12-08-2000||10:48 PM||||They fall out allot, usually on the road where most people don't see them. The bracket rots off them. its pretty common.||||reg||1
